# Copy to .env. Nothing here is required to boot; uncomment what you need.
#
# Unprefixed vars are read by apps/server in dev (`wrangler dev
# --env-file ../../.env`). VITE_ vars are read by apps/tanstack through Vite's
# `envDir`, inlined at build time.
#
# Deployed values never live here: non-secrets go in wrangler.jsonc "vars",
# secrets through `wrangler secret put NAME`.

# apps/server, non-secret. Also add it to wrangler.jsonc "vars" when deployed.
# EXAMPLE_PUBLIC_VAR=

# apps/server, secret. `wrangler secret put EXAMPLE_SECRET` when deployed.
# EXAMPLE_SECRET=

# apps/tanstack, public and build-time. Declare it in src/env.d.ts first.
# VITE_PUBLIC_VAR=

# D1 needs no credentials here: wrangler applies migrations through its own login.
